# Design System

All UI must follow this visual identity. Do not introduce competing palettes, decorative fonts, or theatrical motion.

Landing (`/` and `/intro`) stays on electric blue. Inner routes (`/home`, `/about`, `/work`, `/blog`, `/book`) use the inverted house pair until the user presses Spray.

## Palette

| Token | Hex | Use |
|---|---|---|
| Landing background | `#4545FF` | Gateway and RSVP canvas only |
| Landing text | `#DFDFFF` | Gateway and RSVP copy |
| Logo (gateway) | `#0B0CB4` | Idle lockup on the landing only |
| Inner background | `#DFDFFF` | Unsprayed factory pages |
| Inner text | `#4545FF` | Unsprayed factory copy and chrome |
| Logo (inner, unsprayed) | `#0B0CB4` | Nav lockup until Spray (`--brand-logo`) |
| Muted text | `#5A5A99` | Soft labels (`--text-muted`, syn-comment/property) |
| Line numbers | `#985304` | Factory gutter (`--syn-number`) |

Do not paint inner routes with landing electric blue as the unsprayed default. Spray is the only switch off the inverted pair.

## Grid

Use a 1px high-contrast structural grid. Borders and dividers on inner pages use `color-mix(in srgb, #4545FF 22%, transparent)`.

Treat layout as an engineering drawing: visible edges, aligned columns, no soft drop shadows or glassmorphism. IDE chrome uses `--border-ide` / `--ide-chrome` (18% / 8%).

## Typography

- **Display** (headlines, titles): Unbounded (`type-display` / `type-title` / `type-heading` / `type-subhead`).
- **Body and UI** (prose, buttons, inputs, nav, badges, labels, metadata): JetBrains Mono (`type-body` / `type-prose` / `font-jetbrains` / `font-mono`).

Never set display copy in JetBrains. Never set body or controls in Unbounded.

## Motion

Reveals are clean and humble. Default Framer Motion pattern:

- `opacity: 0 → 1`
- `translateY(10px) → 0`

No bounce, spring-overshoot, large travel, or staggered spectacle unless a specific interaction requires it. Keep duration short (~0.4s) and easing understated.
